# A chat and a new chat switched on the tape (laid out Medium: MBUI_WIN=600x760 a Mac's): the chat opened by its row,
# the sidebar brought back, 新建对话 pressed, the sidebar brought back, the chat again; the composer goes between their
# places, a new chat left leaves by its own way.
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 900
back
wait 900
tap 新建对话
wait 900
back
wait 900
tap 整理发布清单
wait 900
exit
